    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u3010Game Overview\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game tests the player's observational skills in identifying wanted criminals scattered in various area situations from a first-person perspective, using zoom and pause functions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game can also be enjoyed as a walking simulator, as you will be walking around various areas due to the nature of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000(Note: The person on the wanted list may have a different hairstyle, eyebrows, and beard, so don't get caught up in that.\uff09\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Synopsis\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are in a hospital after being involved in a case and losing your memory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A detective comes to you and asks you to help him find the culprit to solve the case as a material witness.\u00a0A wantedlist will be given to solve the case.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010 About Video Distribution\u3011\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No advance notice is required.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We would appreciate it if you could put a link to the store page of this game in the summary section of the video.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are not responsible for any damage caused by the posting or distribution of videos. Thank you for your understanding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Handling of games\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please refrain from unauthorized reproduction of this game, secondary distribution, or any unauthorized diversion of internal assets by analyzing the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is fiction. It is not related to any real person or organization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
